Subject: [PATCH 3/3] bluetooth: audio: Select stock VINTF declaration

[metroid/evo] Rebased onto lineage-23.2; only context moved (upstream added
aconfig_lib_cc_static_link.defaults to the defaults list). Change is identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RTyThMzCkh5fd3Ct1JP62p
---
 bluetooth/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/bluetooth/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp b/bluetooth/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
index c2cc681..2f34577 100644
--- a/bluetooth/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
+++ b/bluetooth/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
@@ -10,7 +10,10 @@ package {
 cc_library_shared {
     name: "android.hardware.bluetooth.audio-impl",
     vendor: true,
-    vintf_fragments: ["bluetooth_audio.xml"],
+    vintf_fragments: select(soong_config_variable("metroid", "stock_bluetooth_audio"), {
+        true: [],
+        default: ["bluetooth_audio.xml"],
+    }),
     defaults: [
         "aconfig_lib_cc_static_link.defaults",
         "latest_android_hardware_bluetooth_audio_ndk_shared",
